{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you take on the role of a tiny bumblebee on a special journey in the form of a 2D platformer with the twist of the Floor being \u201cLava\u201d<br> With precise controls and quick reactions, you'll navigate challenging platforming sections, always in search of floating hearts. Every jump counts \u2013 one mistake, and you fall.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2D platformer with one simple rule: the ground is forbidden</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden hearts and find your own path through each level</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wordless, atmospheric experience \u2013 completely without combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional accessibility features for a flexible, inclusive gameplay experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A moody, immersive soundtrack that carries you through the world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 <i>Wald-Guard</i> is a quiet challenge for anyone who wants to fly without ever touching the ground.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844490?t=1759541792","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844490?t=1759541792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/aa73891029cbbce1d0987ef5cd00126705fa2f17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759541792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844490/aa73891029cbbce1d0987ef5cd00126705fa2f17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759541792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Spl